    "directions": [
      "In a sauce pot or handi, add oil, once it's hot, add cumin seeds, black cardamom, cloves, green cardamom and let it splutter.",
      "Add onions and sautÃ© it for 2-3 minutes or until translucent on high flame.",
      "Add ginger garlic paste and sautÃ© for a minute.",
      "Add degi red chili powder, coriander powder, turmeric powder and mix it well.",
      "Add tomato, salt to taste, water, cover it with a lid and cook it for 4-5 minutes on moderate heat.",
      "Transfer it to the mixer grinder jar and grind it into a smooth paste.",
      "Keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a kadai, add oil, once it's hot, add potato and fry until golden in color.",
      "Transfer it in a bowl or tray and keep it aside for further use.",
      "In a shallow pan, add butter, once itâs melted, add dry fenugreek leaves, fried potatoes and toss it well.",
      "Add degi red chili powder, prepared gravy and sautÃ© it well.",
      "Add onion and toss it for a few seconds on high flame, add capsicum, tomato and give it a good mix.",
      "Add coriander leaves with stem, spring onion and prepared gravy.",
      "Finish it with salt to taste, sugar and mix it well.",
      "Transfer it to a serving dish and garnish it with spring onion, coriander sprig.",
      "Serve hot with roti or paratha."
